{"suttaId":"thag2.30","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[953,964],"vripara":"179"},"segments":{"thag2.30:0.4":"Kaṇhadinnattheragāthā","thag2.30:1.1":"“Upāsitā sappurisā, sutā dhammā abhiṇhaso;","thag2.30:1.3":"Sutvāna paṭipajjissaṃ, añjasaṃ amatogadhaṃ.","thag2.30:2.1":"“Bhavarāgahatassa me sato, bhavarāgo puna me na vijjati;","thag2.30:2.3":"Na cāhu na ca me bhavissati, na ca me etarahi vijjatī”ti.","thag2.30:2.5":"… Kaṇhadinno thero ….","thag2.30:2.6":"Vaggo tatiyo niṭṭhito.","thag2.30:3.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","thag2.30:3.1":"Uttaro bhaddajitthero, sobhito valliyo isi;","thag2.30:3.3":"Vītasoko ca yo thero, puṇṇamāso ca nandako;","thag2.30:3.5":"Bharato bhāradvājo ca, kaṇhadinno mahāmunīti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
